    <string name="legal_last_updated_date">August 11, 2026</string>
    <string name="legal_terms_of_use_body">Welcome to CookSync. These Terms of Use (\"Terms\") govern your access to and use of the CookSync app. By creating an account or using the app, you agree to these Terms.&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt; &lt;b&gt;1. Your account&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt; You must provide accurate information when creating an account and are responsible for keeping your login credentials confidential. You\'re responsible for all activity that happens under your account.&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt; &lt;b&gt;2. Content you share&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt; Recipes, photos, comments, and ratings you post (\"your content\") remain yours. By posting it, you grant CookSync a non-exclusive, worldwide license to host, display, and distribute it within the app so other users can view it. You\'re responsible for making sure you have the right to share anything you upload.&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt; &lt;b&gt;3. Acceptable use&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt; Don\'t post content that\'s unlawful, infringes someone else\'s rights, or is abusive or misleading. Don\'t attempt to disrupt the service, scrape it at scale, or interfere with other users\' accounts.&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt; &lt;b&gt;4. Third-party services&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt; Recipe photos and avatars are stored using Cloudinary, a third-party media hosting provider. Uploading an image means it will be transmitted to and stored by Cloudinary on CookSync\'s behalf.&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt; &lt;b&gt;5. Termination&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt; You may stop using CookSync and delete your account at any time from Account details. We may suspend or terminate accounts that violate these Terms.&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt; &lt;b&gt;6. Disclaimer&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt; CookSync is provided \"as is.\" Recipes are submitted by the community; we don\'t guarantee their accuracy, safety, or nutritional content. Use your own judgment, especially around allergens and food safety.&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt; &lt;b&gt;7. Changes to these Terms&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt; We may update these Terms from time to time. Continuing to use the app after a change means you accept the updated Terms.&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt; &lt;b&gt;8. Contact&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt; Questions about these Terms can be sent to the app\'s support contact listed on your account page.</string>
    <string name="legal_privacy_policy_body">This Privacy Policy explains what information CookSync collects, how it\'s used, and the choices you have.&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt; &lt;b&gt;1. Information we collect&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt; Account information (name, email, password), profile details you choose to add (city, bio, avatar), the recipes, photos, favorites, and reviews you create, and your in-app cooking preferences (e.g. keep-screen-awake, timer sound).&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt; &lt;b&gt;2. How we use it&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt; To operate your account, show your content to other users where you\'ve chosen to make it public, personalize the app, and keep the service secure (for example, refreshing your login session).&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt; &lt;b&gt;3. Image storage via Cloudinary&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt; Photos you upload — avatars and recipe photos — are sent directly from your device to Cloudinary, our media hosting provider, using a short-lived signed upload link issued by our server. The image files themselves never pass through CookSync\'s own servers.&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt; &lt;b&gt;4. Cookies &amp; local storage&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt; The app stores a session (access and refresh tokens) and a few local preferences on your device so you stay signed in and your device settings are remembered. These aren\'t used for third-party advertising.&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt; &lt;b&gt;5. Sharing of information&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt; We don\'t sell your data. Your published recipes and favorites are shown to other users only according to the privacy choices you set in Account details; your private notes always stay hidden.&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt; &lt;b&gt;6. Data retention &amp; deletion&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt; If you delete your account, your recipes and reviews are hidden immediately and your account is permanently deleted after 30 days, unless you log back in within that window to cancel the deletion.&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt; &lt;b&gt;7. Your choices&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt; You can review and update your profile information, toggle what\'s visible on your public profile, and delete your account at any time from Account details.&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt; &lt;b&gt;8. Changes to this policy&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt; We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. Continuing to use the app after a change means you accept the updated policy.&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt; &lt;b&gt;9. Contact us&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt; Questions about this policy can be sent to the app\'s support contact listed on your account page.</string>

